{"id":1120401,"chapter_id":1120401,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"解释一下吧，为什么要做出这种举动？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401002,"trial_step":2,"drawing":1120401},{"step":2,"speaker":"多莉","content":"嗯……很重要么？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401003,"trial_step":3,"drawing":1120401},{"step":3,"content":"你没说话，只是调出大屏幕，按下了监控录像的播放键。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401004,"trial_step":4,"drawing":1120401},{"step":4,"content":"录像中的多莉不住地挥动着棒球棍，将面前的死役统统打飞。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401006,"trial_step":6,"drawing":1120401},{"step":5,"speaker":"多莉","content":"这不是很正常？我只是在正常执行任务啊。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401007,"trial_step":7,"drawing":1120402},{"step":6,"speaker":"多莉","content":"要是冤枉我，你可得赔给我一张新城的棒球海报！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401008,"trial_step":8,"drawing":1120402},{"step":7,"content":"你没管多莉，只是一直点着快进。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401009,"trial_step":9,"drawing":1120401},{"step":8,"content":"现场发生了猛烈爆炸，烟雾将录像画面完全遮蔽。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401010,"trial_step":10,"drawing":1120401},{"step":9,"content":"烟雾缓缓散去，只见多莉挥着棒球棍怒吼着冲向你，似乎已然把你当成了敌人。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401011,"trial_step":11,"drawing":1120401},{"step":10,"content":"你按下了暂停键。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401012,"trial_step":12,"drawing":1120401},{"step":11,"options":["不想解释一下吗？","我觉得你坐在这里一点都不冤"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401013,"trial_step":13,"course":3,"drawing":1120401,"choices":[{"text":"不想解释一下吗？","goto":14},{"text":"我觉得你坐在这里一点都不冤","goto":null}]},{"step":12,"speaker":"多莉","content":"唉。说实话，我对你有点失望。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401014,"trial_step":14,"drawing":1120404},{"step":13,"speaker":"多莉","content":"你怎么和FAC那伙人说一样的话？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401015,"trial_step":15,"drawing":1120401},{"step":14,"content":"别说这些，你是怎么回答他们的？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401016,"trial_step":16,"drawing":1120401},{"step":15,"content":"顺便一提，我不觉得这是什么低级问题。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401017,"trial_step":17,"drawing":1120401},{"step":16,"speaker":"多莉","content":"当然就说自己失控了呗，他们顺带还对我进行了全面检查。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401018,"trial_step":18,"drawing":1120404},{"step":17,"speaker":"多莉","content":"懂么？送我回来就是因为<color=#fb9259>没·查·出·问·题</color>","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401019,"trial_step":19,"drawing":1120404},{"step":18,"speaker":"多莉","content":"现在你让我坐在这……是想质疑FAC的决定？嗯？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401020,"trial_step":20,"drawing":1120404},{"step":19,"content":"多莉抱起手臂，俨然一副“你能拿我怎么办”的态度。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401021,"trial_step":21,"drawing":1120404},{"step":20,"content":"FAC的决定不容置喙，但多莉在这次行动中的表现实在太过诡异，你甚至调取了FAC中多莉的训练记录来进行对比。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401022,"trial_step":22,"drawing":1120404},{"step":21,"content":"你有着强大的力量，并且能在我放松警惕时，挣开“枷锁”。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401023,"trial_step":23,"drawing":1120404},{"step":22,"content":"结合FAC的调查报告，我觉得……你的能力不止于此。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401024,"trial_step":24,"drawing":1120404},{"step":23,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":25,"course":6,"drawing":1120404},{"step":24,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":25,"course":6,"drawing":1120404},{"step":25,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置3","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":25,"course":6,"drawing":1120404},{"step":26,"options":["选择1"],"jump":[5],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":25,"course":6,"drawing":1120404},{"step":27,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置4","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":25,"course":6,"drawing":1120404},{"step":28,"options":["选择1","选择2"],"jump":[7,9],"style":4,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":25,"course":6,"drawing":1120404},{"step":29,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":25,"course":6,"drawing":1120404},{"step":30,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":25,"course":6,"drawing":1120404},{"step":31,"content":"“关于禁闭者多莉能力的相关调查结果”","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401026,"trial_step":26,"drawing":1120404},{"step":32,"content":"通过过往的记录，以及在MBCC进行的30次适应训练中……\n我们发现禁闭者多莉的能力为“狂暴”。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401027,"trial_step":27,"drawing":1120404},{"step":33,"content":"但在进入狂暴状态下，她会进入无意识状态。\n在该状态下，禁闭者会对周围的一切物品进行破坏行为。\n且只有管理局局长的能力才可让她解除该状态。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401028,"trial_step":28,"drawing":1120404},{"step":34,"content":"经过分析，我们可以确定。\n禁闭者多莉的狂暴状态\n与其意识到自身的安全受到威胁有着最直接的关系。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401029,"trial_step":29,"drawing":1120404},{"step":35,"content":"在进行“战斗行为”的情况下。\n多莉会出于本能地使用能力保护自己。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401030,"trial_step":30,"drawing":1120404},{"step":36,"content":"在MBCC的场地中，我们尝试使用战斗装置来对其能力进行量化。\n初步测试非常成功，但供测试的机器人被全部破坏。\n预计在下周可进行新一轮的量化测试。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401031,"trial_step":31,"drawing":1120404},{"step":37,"speaker":"多莉","content":"呿，我还以为是什么呢，结果还是要做那种没意义的测试？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401032,"trial_step":32,"drawing":1120402},{"step":38,"speaker":"多莉","content":"听好了，我的能力失控，只是因为情绪激动，不是因为什么自身安全受到威胁。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401033,"trial_step":33,"drawing":1120401},{"step":39,"speaker":"多莉","content":"因为任务地点离新城棒球场很近，我只是听到了观众呐喊的声音，就已经失去了意识。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401034,"trial_step":34,"drawing":1120401},{"step":40,"content":"既然如此，FAC为什么不根据当事人禁闭者的描述来撰写报告？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401035,"trial_step":35,"drawing":1120401},{"step":41,"speaker":"多莉","content":"很简单，我是辛迪加人，他们觉得我在骗他们。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401036,"trial_step":36,"drawing":1120404},{"step":42,"options":["你似乎对FAC有偏见。"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401037,"trial_step":37,"course":3,"drawing":1120404,"choices":[{"text":"你似乎对FAC有偏见。","goto":38}]},{"step":43,"content":"FAC向来不会做出这么主观的判断。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401038,"trial_step":38,"drawing":1120404},{"step":44,"speaker":"多莉","content":"哈……怎么不会？当时我可是被他们打过的，还好我够厉害，把他们都放倒了。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401039,"trial_step":39,"drawing":1120401},{"step":45,"content":"为什么FAC会和你有交集？你明明在辛迪加。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401040,"trial_step":40,"drawing":1120401},{"step":46,"speaker":"多莉","content":"嗯……我……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401041,"trial_step":41,"drawing":1120406},{"step":47,"speaker":"多莉","content":"我……不小心打伤了新城人而已。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401043,"trial_step":43,"drawing":1120406},{"step":48,"content":"打伤人应该由你们辛迪加的治安官来管教你，怎么可能轮到FAC出场？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401044,"trial_step":44,"drawing":1120406},{"step":49,"speaker":"多莉","content":"辛迪加的治安官打不过我。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401045,"trial_step":45,"drawing":1120402},{"step":50,"content":"难道新城的就能打过你？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401046,"trial_step":46,"drawing":1120402},{"step":51,"speaker":"多莉","content":"新……新城？不……不是，他们是FAC直属的。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401047,"trial_step":47,"drawing":1120406},{"step":52,"content":"她的谎言漏洞百出，但让你疑惑的是她为什么要编造这漏洞百出的谎言。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401048,"trial_step":48,"drawing":1120406},{"step":53,"content":"你拿出了当年的新闻。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401049,"trial_step":49,"drawing":1120406},{"step":54,"content":"测试音效的打断逻辑","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":50,"course":6,"drawing":1120406},{"step":55,"content":"播放一个长音效，会有个前奏，稍等一会儿。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":50,"course":6,"drawing":1120406},{"step":56,"content":"播放相同音效，会继续延续。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":50,"course":6,"drawing":1120406},{"step":57,"content":"暂停配置音效，这里测试一下打断。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":50,"course":6,"drawing":1120406},{"step":58,"content":"播放一个稍短的音效，在这里等待它结束。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":50,"course":6,"drawing":1120406},{"step":59,"content":"配置同名音效，看能否再次播放。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":50,"course":6,"drawing":1120406},{"step":60,"content":"结束测试。","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":50,"course":6,"drawing":1120406},{"step":61,"content":"9月13日上午9:30\n两年一度的狄斯职业棒球联赛在新城体育场召开。\n开幕战为基洋队对阵高地人队。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401051,"trial_step":51,"drawing":1120406},{"step":62,"content":"基洋队比分一度落后，她们的种子选手多莉也发挥不佳。\n并且在比赛的33分钟时，发生了恶性打人事件。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401052,"trial_step":52,"drawing":1120406},{"step":63,"content":"基洋队的多莉与高地人队的哈利娅卡产生摩擦。\n并对其进行殴打，让比赛进入混乱。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401053,"trial_step":53,"drawing":1120406},{"step":64,"content":"所幸驻守的FAC队员及时赶到。\n他们控制住了现场，让赛场恢复了秩序。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401054,"trial_step":54,"drawing":1120406},{"step":65,"content":"但由于干扰，场地需要临时检修。\n赛程顺延一天。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401055,"trial_step":55,"drawing":1120406},{"step":66,"content":"这两队的比赛将推迟到下周进行。\n多莉选手则被罚下。\n等待她的则是终身禁赛。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401056,"trial_step":56,"drawing":1120406},{"step":67,"content":"你打了对方的球员，又打了进场维护秩序的FAC，至于你的被打，更是提都没提。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401057,"trial_step":57,"drawing":1120406},{"step":68,"content":"你每读一句，多莉的脸就越往下埋一分。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401058,"trial_step":58,"drawing":1120406},{"step":69,"content":"所以说……你为什么要说FAC打你？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401059,"trial_step":59,"drawing":1120406},{"step":70,"speaker":"多莉","content":"……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401060,"trial_step":60,"drawing":1120406},{"step":71,"speaker":"多莉","content":"因为……因为！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401061,"trial_step":61,"drawing":1120406},{"step":72,"content":"多莉涨红了脸。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401062,"trial_step":62,"drawing":1120405},{"step":73,"speaker":"多莉","content":"啊！烦死了……因为要是不这么说的话，我就连辛迪加都回不去了！我只能说是被打了之后的应激反应！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401063,"trial_step":63,"drawing":1120405},{"step":74,"speaker":"多莉","content":"我从辛迪加跑到新城，就是为了参加这场比赛，还顶着那个什么西区条例！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401064,"trial_step":64,"drawing":1120401},{"step":75,"speaker":"多莉","content":"FAC在比赛中途发现了我的身份，他们想强行暂停比赛把我抓走，我当然不答应！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401065,"trial_step":65,"drawing":1120401},{"step":76,"options":["你居然打赢了他们？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401066,"trial_step":66,"course":3,"drawing":1120401,"choices":[{"text":"你居然打赢了他们？","goto":67}]},{"step":77,"speaker":"多莉","content":"当然，我第一次发动能力就把他们全打趴下了，厉害吧。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401067,"trial_step":67,"drawing":1120401},{"step":78,"speaker":"多莉","content":"“就算要抓我，也要等我把这场棒球打完。”我当时就这么想着，身体里就有了力量。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401068,"trial_step":68,"drawing":1120401},{"step":79,"speaker":"多莉","content":"是“情绪”让我战胜了他们，我直接用那根棒球棍把他们全都打飞了。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401069,"trial_step":69,"drawing":1120401},{"step":80,"content":"你的情绪居然会对你的能力产生这么大的加成？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401070,"trial_step":70,"drawing":1120401},{"step":81,"speaker":"多莉","content":"局长，现在把你想象成我。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401071,"trial_step":71,"drawing":1120404},{"step":82,"speaker":"多莉","content":"你第一次登上梦想中的舞台，在所有观众的欢呼声中，马上就要完成比分逆转时，有人来让你下场，你不会愤怒么？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401072,"trial_step":72,"drawing":1120404},{"step":83,"content":"在这之后你逃回了辛迪加，说FAC打你，让你没办法比赛？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401073,"trial_step":73,"drawing":1120404},{"step":84,"speaker":"多莉","content":"哼……我那时是第一次启动能力，没办法好好控制自己。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401074,"trial_step":74,"drawing":1120402},{"step":85,"speaker":"多莉","content":"要是我还能参赛的话……我一定能控制住自己，不再被那些FAC发现！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401075,"trial_step":75,"drawing":1120402},{"step":86,"options":["算了吧"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401076,"trial_step":76,"course":3,"drawing":1120402,"choices":[{"text":"算了吧","goto":77}]},{"step":87,"content":"今天要是我不在，你可能就要被FAC当死役直接击毙了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401077,"trial_step":77,"drawing":1120402},{"step":88,"speaker":"多莉","content":"……哼。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401078,"trial_step":78,"drawing":1120405},{"step":89,"content":"面对你的呛声，多莉直接哑火。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401079,"trial_step":79,"drawing":1120405},{"step":90,"content":"多莉的失控真的只是因为情绪？FAC的调查真的出错了？","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401080,"trial_step":80,"drawing":1120405},{"step":91,"content":"你的枷锁一定不会出问题，但是今天她却偏偏脱离了你的控制。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401081,"trial_step":81,"drawing":1120405},{"step":92,"content":"到底还有什么地方出了问题……难道是战斗流程？","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401082,"trial_step":82,"drawing":1120405},{"step":93,"speaker":"多莉","content":"唉——还有没有问题了啊！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401083,"trial_step":83,"drawing":1120402},{"step":94,"speaker":"多莉","content":"没有就放我回去吧，今天的空挥我还没练呢！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401084,"trial_step":84,"drawing":1120402},{"step":95,"content":"多莉表现得有些不耐烦，她标志性的球棒则被放在房间的角落。在与FAC的战斗中，它也立下了汗马功劳。不过……多莉并不是经常使用它进行战斗。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401085,"trial_step":85,"drawing":1120402},{"step":96,"content":"看来还有一种可能，你打算再问问多莉。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401086,"trial_step":86,"drawing":1120402},{"step":97,"options":["你经常用棒球棍战斗么？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401087,"trial_step":87,"course":3,"drawing":1120402,"choices":[{"text":"你经常用棒球棍战斗么？","goto":88}]},{"step":98,"speaker":"多莉","content":"突然问这个干什么？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401088,"trial_step":88,"drawing":1120402},{"step":99,"speaker":"多莉","content":"不是很经常，因为有的死役不配，在辛迪加，拳头最直接。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401089,"trial_step":89,"drawing":1120402},{"step":100,"content":"那30场测试里你是不是也没用棒球棍？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401090,"trial_step":90,"drawing":1120402},{"step":101,"speaker":"多莉","content":"当然没有，我怕把测试仪器打坏了，让你们难堪。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401091,"trial_step":91,"drawing":1120402},{"step":102,"speaker":"多莉","content":"但这些东西似乎比我想象中还要不结实。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401092,"trial_step":92,"drawing":1120402},{"step":103,"options":["你每天都会练习挥棒，对吧？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401093,"trial_step":93,"course":3,"drawing":1120402,"choices":[{"text":"你每天都会练习挥棒，对吧？","goto":94}]},{"step":104,"speaker":"多莉","content":"我可是一直都在备战新城的棒球联赛呢。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401094,"trial_step":94,"drawing":1120401},{"step":105,"content":"你挥棒的时候会有什么感觉？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401095,"trial_step":95,"drawing":1120401},{"step":106,"speaker":"多莉","content":"感觉？想上场比赛那种烦躁感算么？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401096,"trial_step":96,"drawing":1120404},{"step":107,"content":"看来禁赛对你的影响很大。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401097,"trial_step":97,"drawing":1120404},{"step":108,"speaker":"多莉","content":"禁赛的是作为禁闭者的多莉，和我棒球运动员多莉有什么关系？你会帮我的对吧，局长？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401098,"trial_step":98,"drawing":1120401},{"step":109,"content":"你认真点，我在问你正事。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401099,"trial_step":99,"drawing":1120401},{"step":110,"speaker":"多莉","content":"我没开玩笑，我真的很想回去打一场棒球！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401100,"trial_step":100,"drawing":1120401},{"step":111,"speaker":"多莉","content":"你能给我争取一次机会么！局长，你要是担心的话，就待在台下用你那个什么枷锁看我的情况就好！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401101,"trial_step":101,"drawing":1120403},{"step":112,"speaker":"多莉","content":"我一定会控制住自己的！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401102,"trial_step":102,"drawing":1120403},{"step":113,"options":["抱歉","恐怕不行"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401103,"trial_step":103,"course":3,"drawing":1120403,"choices":[{"text":"抱歉","goto":104},{"text":"恐怕不行","goto":null}]},{"step":114,"speaker":"多莉","content":"诶……真小气。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401104,"trial_step":104,"drawing":1120402},{"step":115,"content":"根据我的分析，你应该没什么机会上场打棒球了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401105,"trial_step":105,"drawing":1120402},{"step":116,"speaker":"多莉","content":"在我的印象中……你应该不是这种喜欢讲笑话的人啊……哈哈哈。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401106,"trial_step":106,"drawing":1120404},{"step":117,"speaker":"多莉","content":"局长你说实话……你是不是不想帮我？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401107,"trial_step":107,"drawing":1120404},{"step":118,"options":["是","不是"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401108,"trial_step":108,"course":3,"drawing":1120404,"choices":[{"text":"是","goto":109},{"text":"不是","goto":null}]},{"step":119,"content":"你不是棒球运动员，你是禁闭者。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401109,"trial_step":109,"drawing":1120404},{"step":120,"speaker":"多莉","content":"哈……哈哈哈……这种陈词滥调我真的听了太多。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401110,"trial_step":110,"drawing":1120401},{"step":121,"speaker":"多莉","content":"我都说了，有你在的话，我一定可以控制住自己的！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401111,"trial_step":111,"drawing":1120401},{"step":122,"speaker":"多莉","content":"你说对不对？嗯……这对你来说一定很简单的吧？今天一定只是你没集中注意力而已。哎呀……我都明白的。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401112,"trial_step":112,"drawing":1120401},{"step":123,"content":"我今天已经在尽全力控制你的枷锁了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401113,"trial_step":113,"drawing":1120401},{"step":124,"speaker":"多莉","content":"那就是状态不好！哎呀……谁都有状态不好的时候的！就像我，也不是每次都能打出全垒打的。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401114,"trial_step":114,"drawing":1120404},{"step":125,"options":["告知真相","道歉"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401115,"trial_step":115,"course":3,"drawing":1120404,"choices":[{"text":"告知真相","goto":116},{"text":"道歉","goto":117}]},{"step":126,"content":"我是真的认为你永远都不能上场打棒球。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401116,"trial_step":116,"drawing":1120404,"next":[119]},{"step":127,"content":"抱歉，我没办法。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401117,"trial_step":117,"drawing":1120404},{"step":128,"content":"你真的可能……永远都不能上场打棒球了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401118,"trial_step":118,"drawing":1120404,"next":[119]},{"step":129,"speaker":"多莉","content":"再说这种话，我真的要生气了。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401119,"trial_step":119,"drawing":1120401},{"step":130,"content":"不是我不想帮，而是我帮不了，你看看这个。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401120,"trial_step":120,"drawing":1120401},{"step":131,"content":"测试全屏类文本对演出效果的支持","style":14,"background":50409,"log_type":1,"src_id":3,"trial_step":121,"course":6,"drawing":1120401},{"step":132,"content":"转场…………………………………………………………………………","style":14,"background":50410,"log_type":1,"src_id":3,"trial_step":121,"course":6,"drawing":1120401},{"step":133,"content":"音效及语音…………………………………………………………………………","voice":["vo_cgplot_100002"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":14,"background":50410,"log_type":1,"src_id":3,"trial_step":121,"course":6,"drawing":1120401},{"step":134,"content":"一次性特效…………………………………………………………………………","style":14,"background":50410,"log_type":1,"src_id":3,"trial_step":121,"course":6,"drawing":1120401},{"step":135,"content":"循环特效…………………………………………………………………………","style":14,"background":50410,"log_type":1,"src_id":3,"trial_step":121,"course":6,"drawing":1120401},{"step":136,"content":"循环特效…………………………………………………………………………","style":14,"background":50410,"log_type":1,"src_id":3,"trial_step":121,"course":6,"drawing":1120401},{"step":137,"content":"你走到角落，将被打断的球棒拿到她的面前。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401122,"trial_step":122,"drawing":1120401},{"step":138,"content":"金属的球棒被外力挤压，最终达到疲劳，断裂。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401123,"trial_step":123,"drawing":1120401},{"step":139,"content":"断裂面上沾满了死役的血污，它的表面也因为击打而变得坑坑洼洼。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401124,"trial_step":124,"drawing":1120401},{"step":140,"content":"你的暴走和这东西，脱不开干系。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401125,"trial_step":125,"drawing":1120401},{"step":141,"speaker":"多莉","content":"……这是在讲什么冷笑话么？是不是还要我配合你一下？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401126,"trial_step":126,"drawing":1120404},{"step":142,"speaker":"多莉","content":"你别开玩笑了，在觉醒能力之后，我又不是没打过棒球。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401127,"trial_step":127,"drawing":1120401},{"step":143,"options":["我不否认你先前的观点"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401128,"trial_step":128,"course":3,"drawing":1120401,"choices":[{"text":"我不否认你先前的观点","goto":129}]},{"step":144,"content":"你当然是最了解自己的人。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401129,"trial_step":129,"drawing":1120401},{"step":145,"content":"但，你似乎没怎么用过这根球棍战斗？它往往会留给你潜意识中的“强敌”。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401130,"trial_step":130,"drawing":1120401},{"step":146,"content":"我说的对么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401131,"trial_step":131,"drawing":1120401},{"step":147,"speaker":"多莉","content":"……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401132,"trial_step":132,"drawing":1120402},{"step":148,"speaker":"多莉","content":"是————","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401133,"trial_step":133,"drawing":1120402},{"step":149,"content":"据我的观察，你的能力不仅与情绪有关。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401134,"trial_step":134,"drawing":1120402},{"step":150,"content":"更多的，也与这个东西有关。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401135,"trial_step":135,"drawing":1120402},{"step":151,"content":"你晃了晃手中的球棍。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401136,"trial_step":136,"drawing":1120402},{"step":152,"speaker":"多莉","content":"唉……你能不能别再逗我了，我真笑不出来了。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401137,"trial_step":137,"drawing":1120404},{"step":153,"speaker":"多莉","content":"我平时空挥完之后就开始练击球了，也一样没进入到像今天的那种状态。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401138,"trial_step":138,"drawing":1120404},{"step":154,"content":"不如这样吧，我们打个赌。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401139,"trial_step":139,"drawing":1120404},{"step":155,"content":"如果你赢了，我就去让你走进新城棒球场，痛快地打一场棒球。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401140,"trial_step":140,"drawing":1120404},{"step":156,"speaker":"多莉","content":"说什么鬼……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401141,"trial_step":141,"drawing":1120404},{"step":157,"speaker":"多莉","content":"等……新城棒球赛参赛资格！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401142,"trial_step":142,"drawing":1120401},{"step":158,"speaker":"多莉","content":"你认真的！？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401143,"trial_step":143,"drawing":1120401},{"step":159,"content":"当然，前提是你要按我的要求来。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401144,"trial_step":144,"drawing":1120401},{"step":160,"speaker":"多莉","content":"我先说好，你不准提什么奇怪的要求哦。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401145,"trial_step":145,"drawing":1120405},{"step":161,"options":["怎么可能"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401146,"trial_step":146,"course":3,"drawing":1120405,"choices":[{"text":"怎么可能","goto":147}]},{"step":162,"content":"下次去锈河的任务，你和我一起来。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401147,"trial_step":147,"drawing":1120405},{"step":163,"content":"哦，对了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401148,"trial_step":148,"drawing":1120405},{"step":164,"content":"记得带上棒球棍。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401149,"trial_step":149,"drawing":1120405},{"step":165,"speaker":"多莉","content":"……这么简单？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401150,"trial_step":150,"drawing":1120402},{"step":166,"content":"嗯，就这么简单，都是最弱的死役，可能都不需要你发动能力。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401151,"trial_step":151,"drawing":1120401},{"step":167,"content":"“情绪”只是多莉发动能力的其中的一个诱因，所有无法控制的情况，都集中在那一根球棒上。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401152,"trial_step":152,"drawing":1120401},{"step":168,"content":"在新城棒球场，她拿着棒球棍打倒了无数的FAC士兵。出任务时，她用这根球棍挣脱了你的枷锁。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401153,"trial_step":153,"drawing":1120401},{"step":169,"content":"而没有这根球棍时，她只是个爆发力较强，不怎么听话的禁闭者而已。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401154,"trial_step":154,"drawing":1120401},{"step":170,"content":"你相信，这一切的秘密，都集中在这根球棍上。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401155,"trial_step":155,"drawing":1120401},{"step":171,"speaker":"多莉","content":"哈哈哈哈哈！要不然你直接把票送给我吧，这任务简单得连那些FAC的菜鸟都能做。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401156,"trial_step":156,"drawing":1120403},{"step":172,"content":"看着逐渐嚣张的多莉，你叹了口气。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401157,"trial_step":157,"drawing":1120403},{"step":173,"content":"当然，在等任务的这几天，你要在禁闭室里待命。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401158,"trial_step":158,"drawing":1120403},{"step":174,"speaker":"多莉","content":"禁闭室！？那……那不是犯了重大错误的禁闭者才去的地方么……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401159,"trial_step":159,"drawing":1120402},{"step":175,"content":"袭击MBCC局长难道是什么小错误么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401160,"trial_step":160,"drawing":1120402},{"step":176,"speaker":"多莉","content":"……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401161,"trial_step":161,"drawing":1120405},{"step":177,"content":"等会儿夜莺会带你去的。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401162,"trial_step":162,"drawing":1120405},{"step":178,"speaker":"多莉","content":"那我能带球棒么？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401163,"trial_step":163,"drawing":1120402},{"step":179,"content":"不行，禁闭室内禁止携带任何武器。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401164,"trial_step":164,"drawing":1120402},{"step":180,"speaker":"多莉","content":"可是我只想练一下……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401165,"trial_step":165,"drawing":1120402},{"step":181,"options":["不行"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401166,"trial_step":166,"course":3,"drawing":1120402,"choices":[{"text":"不行","goto":167}]},{"step":182,"speaker":"多莉","content":"啧……等我出来……我一定不会放过你的……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401167,"trial_step":167,"drawing":1120402},{"step":183,"speaker":"多莉","content":"不过就是个MBCC局长……不过就是个局长！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401168,"trial_step":168,"drawing":1120402},{"step":184,"content":"留下在座位上咬牙切齿的多莉，你离开了审查室。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220401169,"trial_step":169,"drawing":1120402}]}